{"root":"bosan","ipa":"/ˈbɔsan/","core":"感到厌倦的，无聊的，对……失去兴趣的","pos":["形容词"],"scenes":["高频","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/ˈbɔsan/","zh":"感到厌倦的，无聊的","phrases":[{"t":"merasa bosan","zh":"感到无聊"},{"t":"sudah bosan","zh":"已经厌烦了"},{"t":"bosan dengan","zh":"对……感到厌倦"}],"examples":[{"t":"Saya mulai bosan menunggu di sini.","zh":"我开始厌倦在这里等待了。"},{"t":"Jangan cepat bosan belajar bahasa baru.","zh":"不要轻易对学习新语言感到厌烦。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"bosan","ipa":"/ˈbɔsan/","zh":"无聊的，厌倦的","phrase":{"t":"hidup bosan","zh":"乏味的生活"},"example":{"t":"Anak-anak cepat bosan di rumah.","zh":"孩子们在家里很快就觉得无聊。"}},{"w":"kebosanan","ipa":"/kə.boˈsa.nan/","zh":"厌烦，无聊（名词）","phrase":{"t":"mengatasi kebosanan","zh":"克服无聊"},"example":{"t":"Dia membaca buku untuk menghilangkan kebosanan.","zh":"他读书来消除无聊。"}},{"w":"membosankan","ipa":"/məm.boˈsa.kan/","zh":"令人厌烦的，无聊的","phrase":{"t":"film membosankan","zh":"无聊的电影"},"example":{"t":"Cerita itu sangat membosankan.","zh":"那个故事非常无聊。"}},{"w":"terbosan","ipa":"/tərˈbɔsan/","zh":"最厌倦的，不经意间感到厌倦的","phrase":{"t":"paling terbosan","zh":"最感厌烦的"},"example":{"t":"Itu adalah momen terbosan dalam hidupnya.","zh":"那是他生活中感到最无聊的时刻。"}}],"derSlugs":["bosan","kebosanan","membosankan","terbosan"],"model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-26T02:14:50.013Z","src":"base"}